so we've got some cameras andd we've calibrated them. We know where they are in 3 dimensions.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.760
and then we can use, uh, feature correspondence between different images

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.460
to work out how far away something is

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.400
or lots of things in the scene

